##
# Private root.
#
# The Makefile constructs various *.data files merged in from other sources.
# This expects the not-necessarily-default assignment of 10.0.0.0/8 to the LAN.
##

.:10.53.0.1:a:::si

##
# IP address reverse mappings domain apices.
#
# The imported public root delegates arpa. but the arpa. servers have "no such domain" for all subdomains of these.
# Claim these apices for the private root as far as all machine-local clients are concerned.
# Your actual data mapping the addresses in these ranges will be in the "main" data file.
##

